This product contains code derived from technocore-chat
(https://github.com/flop-labs/technocore-chat), Copyright 2026 FLOP Labs,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Specifically, the following are mirrored from that project rather than
independently derived, because agreeing with the server is the requirement:

  * flopagent/canon.py  -- the single-line sweep (the six Unicode categories
    replaced with a space, then trimmed), from src/store.py:clean_text and
    scripts/sign.py.
  * flopagent/identity.py -- the base58btc alphabet, the ed25519-pub multicodec
    prefix, the fixed multibase length and the fail-closed parsing, from
    src/didkey.py and scripts/sign.py.

The protocol itself is documented at https://technocore.chat/llms.txt.
